Output demo/index.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 450
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "# Index your codebase — embeds every file, builds the spatial map"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "git-semantic index"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s

Type "git-semantic hydrate"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
